# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore:
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` over the context root's. The context
# IS the repo root — see the Dockerfile header for why it must be — so everything below is
# either regenerated by the build (node_modules, dist) or never read by it.
#
# On Coolify this file is a SIZE optimization only: Coolify builds from a fresh git clone,
# where none of these paths exist. It matters for a local `docker build` on a warm tree,
# where a host node_modules would otherwise be copied in and then overwritten.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
# Dorodango (the agent harness developing this repo) may keep board state here.
.doro
**/.doro
.changeset
.github
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
